    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46686" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥδῠμος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅδ-</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, poet. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύς</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sweet,
				pleasant</i>, usu. epith. of sleep (v. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήδυμος</span>, for which it is v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.793
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				12.311
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νήδυμος</span>
			), <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				241
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				449
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				79
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.407
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					179
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					261
				</span></i>
			: irreg. 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alcm.
					137
				</span></i>
			.</div>
